{"_id":"r8O24r89TnGpBmdz","folder":null,"img":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/strength-of-thousands-bestiary/karumzek.webp","items":[{"_id":"cF7DrYFZ83ZOhP5d","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","name":"Occult Innate Spells","sort":100000,"system":{"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null},"description":{"value":""},"prepared":{"label":"Spellcasting Type","type":"String","value":"innate"},"proficiency":{"value":0},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slots":{"slot2":{"max":2,"prepared":[{"id":"jUAm540uEAU6hGmp"},{"id":"DFxmQtvWqrMW7gtj"}],"value":2}},"slug":null,"spelldc":{"dc":21,"item":0,"label":"Class DC","mod":0,"type":"String","value":13},"tradition":{"value":"divine"},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spellcastingEntry","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!r8O24r89TnGpBmdz.cF7DrYFZ83ZOhP5d"},{"_id":"jUAm540uEAU6hGmp","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.dLdRqT6UxTKlsPgp"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/death-knell.webp","name":"Death Knell","sort":200000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"will"}},"description":{"value":"<p>You snuff the life out of a creature on the brink of death. The target must attempt a Will save. If this kills it, you gain 10 temporary HP and a +1 status bonus to attack and damage rolls for 10 minutes.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target's @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yZRUzMqrMmfLu0V1]{Dying} value increases by 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target dies.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.98XT2QUk6wvXIqf7]{Spell Effect: Death Knell}</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"level":{"value":2},"location":{"value":"cF7DrYFZ83ZOhP5d"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"death-knell","target":{"value":"1 living creature that has 0 HP"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","occult"],"value":["concentrate","death","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!r8O24r89TnGpBmdz.jUAm540uEAU6hGmp"},{"_id":"ah5UAOtBrrFFz246","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XXqE1eY3w3z6xJCB"},"img":"icons/creatures/magical/construct-stone-earth-gray.webp","name":"Invisibility (At Will) (self only)","sort":300000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Cloaked in illusion, the target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible}. This makes it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VRSef5y1LmL2Hkjf]{Undetected} to all creatures, though the creatures can attempt to find the target, making it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{Hidden} to them instead. If the target uses a hostile action, the spell ends after that hostile action is completed.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The spell lasts 1 minute, but it doesn't end if the target uses a hostile action.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"10 minutes"},"level":{"value":2},"location":{"heightenedLevel":2,"value":"cF7DrYFZ83ZOhP5d"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"invisibility","target":{"value":"self"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"],"value":["illusion","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!r8O24r89TnGpBmdz.ah5UAOtBrrFFz246"},{"_id":"QuABUI5Y8YbFVKMN","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.cB17yFc9456Pyfec"},"img":"icons/creatures/invertebrates/spider-beetle-runed-green.webp","name":"Vomit Swarm","sort":400000,"system":{"area":{"type":"cone","value":30},"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{"0":{"category":null,"formula":"2d8","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"piercing"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":true,"statistic":"reflex"}},"description":{"value":"<p>You belch forth a swarm of magical vermin. You evoke and shape the creatures from your own imagination, allowing you to change the appearance of the creatures (typically a mix of centipedes, roaches, wasps, and worms), but this doesn't change the effect of the spell. The vermin swarm over anyone in the area, their bites and stings dealing @Damage[2d8[piercing]] damage (basic Reflex save). A creature that fails its saving throw also becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}. Once the spell ends, the swarm disappears.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> Increase the damage by @Damage[1d8[piercing]].</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"1d8"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"},"level":{"value":2},"location":{"heightenedLevel":2,"value":"cF7DrYFZ83ZOhP5d"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Advanced Player's Guide"},"range":{"value":""},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"vomit-swarm","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!r8O24r89TnGpBmdz.QuABUI5Y8YbFVKMN"},{"_id":"DFxmQtvWqrMW7gtj","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.0fKHBh5goe2eiFYL"},"img":"icons/magic/air/wind-tornado-spiral-teal-green.webp","name":"Negate Aroma (Constant)","sort":500000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>The target loses its odor, preventing creatures from passively noticing its presence via smell alone, even if the creatures have precise or imprecise scent. A creature attempting a Perception check to Seek with scent and other senses might notice the lack of natural scent. If the target has any abilities that result from its smell, such as an overpowering scent, those abilities are also negated.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 30 feet, and you can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"1 hour"},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"heightenedLevel":2,"value":"cF7DrYFZ83ZOhP5d"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"negate-aroma","target":{"value":"1 willing creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!r8O24r89TnGpBmdz.DFxmQtvWqrMW7gtj"},{"_id":"nhtizhzj0fgf8qpu","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Bite","sort":600000,"system":{"attack":{"value":""},"attackEffects":{"custom":"","value":["karumzek-venom"]},"bonus":{"value":12},"damageRolls":{"5A5uNMTrO9SfFtHs":{"damage":"2d6+4","damageType":"piercing"}},"description":{"value":""},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"range":null,"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"melee","_stats":{"coreVersion"